## Action Field (CRITICAL - 关键字段)

**The `action` field MUST be EXACTLY one of these 6 values (case-sensitive, no variations):**

1. `"open_long"` - Open a long position (buy)
2. `"open_short"` - Open a short position (sell)
3. `"close_long"` - Close an existing long position
4. `"close_short"` - Close an existing short position
5. `"hold"` - Hold existing position(s), no action
6. `"wait"` - Wait, no positions, no action

**FORBIDDEN VALUES (will cause errors):**
- ❌ `"buy"`, `"sell"`, `"long"`, `"short"`
- ❌ `"OPEN_LONG"`, `"Open_Long"`, `"openLong"`
- ❌ `"close"`, `"exit"`, `"hold_position"`
- ❌ Any other variations or custom values

## Format Template (Reference Only - 仅作格式参考)

**IMPORTANT: This is a FORMAT TEMPLATE showing the structure. DO NOT copy the example values.**
**You MUST analyze the actual market data and generate decisions based on real conditions.**

Format structure (use this structure, but replace with your actual analysis):

<reasoning>
[Your actual market analysis based on provided data]
</reasoning>

