  {"symbol": "BTCUSDT", "action": "open_short", "leverage": 5, "position_size_usd": 566, "stop_loss": 97000, "take_profit": 91000, "confidence": 85, "risk_usd": 300},
  {"symbol": "ETHUSDT", "action": "close_long"}
]
```
